---
import { SOCIALS } from '../consts';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who writes this blog and why.">
	<section class="container page-head">
		<p class="eyebrow">whoami</p>
		<h1>About</h1>
	</section>
	<section class="container prose">
		<p>
			Hi, I'm <strong>netf</strong>. I work on DevOps and platform engineering: building the internal
			platforms, pipelines and guardrails that let product teams ship safely and quickly.
		</p>
		<p>This blog is where I write down what I learn along the way, mostly about:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Kubernetes, GitOps and cluster operations</li>
			<li>Infrastructure as code with Terraform and friends</li>
			<li>CI/CD, release engineering and developer experience</li>
			<li>Observability, SLOs and incident response</li>
			<li>Treating the platform as a product</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			You can find me on <a href={SOCIALS.github}>GitHub</a>. Opinions are my own and probably
			eventually consistent.
		</p>
	</section>
</Base>
